abstract: >
  Resonance Field Theory (RFT) is a fundamental physics framework describing
  space structure, particle physics, and cosmology through resonance geometry.
  The Mastergleichung (Master Equation) ∂²σ/∂t² - c²∇²σ + κT(r) = 0 has
  remained structurally stable since January 2025. Key result: geometric
  derivation of the fine-structure constant α⁻¹ = 4π³+π²+π = 137.036304
  (2.22 ppm from CODATA).
